  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change and Reduction of Short Lived Climate Pollutants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the U.S. Government&apos;s efforts to reduce Short Lived Climate Pollutants by working to reduce black carbon, methane and HFCs through continued engagement bilaterally with engaged countries and through the existing SLCP reduction initiatives: the Climate and Clean Air Coalition (CCAC), the Global Methane Initiative (GMI), and the Arctic Council.</narrative>
  </description>
